# Membership summary

Members may terminate their membership in writing with a notice period of thirty (30) days, counted from the day the written notice is received [[cite:obs-a00f6977c24d91b5069262ad6f513b91517cd75f "The notice period for members is
thirty (30) days, counted from the day the written notice is received."]].

The expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense. Expenses above this threshold require written approval by the treasurer before they are incurred [[cite:obs-e24888d987bd9883461bed41aa2918eb10394f7e "With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per
single expense. Expenses above the threshold need written approval by the treasurer
before they are incurred."]].
